  "description": "Under Seat Storage Box Fit For 2014-2018 Chevrolet Silverado/GMC Sierra 1500, 2015-2019 Silverado/Sierra 2500 3500 HD Crew Cab. OEDRO Under Seat Storage Box w/ Screws uses the latest technology. No kidding, no smell in bad weather. This Is a great storage bin! You can have all Items stowed away safely in the truck including your two fishing rods and other tools. Won't move away! Very steady!\nFeatures\nPerfect fit. Under-seat storage organizers fit seamlessly into the rear seats to safely store valuables or hide all trash under the rear seats.\nUnique 2-in-1 design. The under-seat gearbox fits your truck precisely and provides a large storage capacity with an additional small box. And the divider makes it easy to store anything in the truck without making any noise.\nTough and durable. Made of tough and durable PP material, it is more organized and prevents your items from slipping on the black non-slip surface.\nEasy to install. The OEDRO Luggage Organizer can be installed quickly and easily in less than 5 minutes using the screws and instructions provided.\n1-Year Warranty | Professional installation recommended for safety.\nFitment\nFit for 2014-2018 Chevrolet Silverado/GMC Sierra 1500.\nFit for 2015-2019 Silverado/Sierra 2500HD 3500 HD Crew Cab.\nEnsure compatibility between your floor mats and our under-seat storage boxes before installation.",
